{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは🙂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、個別握手会ありがとうございました!\nハロウィンということで、仮装(コスプレ)をしました🎃\n普段は着ないような服装を着ました!\n握手会って自分の好きな服を気にせず着れるので幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日着た、写真を載せていきます!\n1部2部･･･ウエイトレス"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMTBC7W73W30J9X9E9AEHT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n赤チェックがお気に入り🍒\n1部は、おんぷちゃんヘア🎶"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMTCCDW024M0NYSQ0AKY15","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部は、ミニお団子ヘア🍡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMTDDZV3H1B18661ZJD1T5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カフェのバイトしてみたかったなあ〜☕"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMTEBSQEREMTMW60W2HY3F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部4部･･･チャイナ服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMTFB1F9F9CWKK5DK106D0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n3部は、ミニ団子×2ヘア 🍡🍡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部は、お団子を外して、ハーフツイン。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMTG9XGSHADN14F305JVNP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> 念願の、ちゃいなーこ🍜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身  "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMTH8XEC08TD12N22P8S5Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nニーハオ〜🇨🇳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、個性的なお洋服をたくさん着ました!\nチャイナ服が好評で嬉しかったです!ラーメンが食べたくなりました🍜\n他に、握手会で来て欲しい服があれば教えてください🙂\nあと、何着てないかなあ〜\n今まで色々着てきたな。アイドルぽい可愛い服が着たいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回は、お花を載せますね〜🌷ありがとう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n⊿長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}